        "text": "把那些气孔和废话全部都删掉",
        "representativeTime": 116.739,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-041.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-009"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-042",
        "start": 117.539,
        "end": 119.508,
        "text": "在我觉得节奏比较慢的地方加上倍速",
        "representativeTime": 118.523,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-042.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-009",
          "SHOT-010"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-043",
        "start": 119.508,
        "end": 122.34,
        "text": "配上一个快捷的bgm，做一个最简单的字幕，Ok",
        "representativeTime": 120.924,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-043.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-010"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-044",
        "start": 122.35,
        "end": 125.01,
        "text": "可以发布了，最后一点是发布时间，你有两个方法",
        "representativeTime": 123.68,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-044.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-010",
          "SHOT-011"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-045",
        "start": 125.01,
        "end": 127.67,
        "text": "第一个方法就看你的后台会有一个播放分值的时间",
        "representativeTime": 126.34,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-045.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-011"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-046",
        "start": 127.67,
        "end": 131.66,
        "text": "你可以选择那个时间，你可以选择我推荐到晚上七点钟，因为心理学告诉你",
        "representativeTime": 129.665,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-046.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-011"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-047",
        "start": 131.67,
        "end": 133.508,
        "text": "人在饥饿的时候他是耐心很差的",
        "representativeTime": 132.589,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-047.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-011"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-048",
        "start": 133.508,
        "end": 135.346,
        "text": "晚上七点钟大多数人都吃饱饭了",
        "representativeTime": 134.427,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-048.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-011"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-049",
        "start": 135.346,
        "end": 137.184,
        "text": "他就会对你稍微宽容一点点赞呀",
        "representativeTime": 136.265,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-049.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-011"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-050",
        "start": 137.184,
        "end": 141.39,
        "text": "完播率呀，是不是有所上升，那今天就在这里，我是人类最强编导，我们",
        "representativeTime": 139.287,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-050.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-011"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-051",
        "start": 141.4,
        "end": 142.036,
        "text": "下期再见",
        "representativeTime": 141.718,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-051.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-011"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
